@anon.e792752b4454889dead1a66caae2c60f.481 = private unnamed_addr constant [393 x i8] c"Whether to allow imports from the third-party `typing_extensions` module for Python versions before a symbol was added to the first-party `typing` module.\0A\0AMany rules try to import symbols from the `typing` module but fall back to `typing_extensions` for earlier versions of Python. This option can be used to disable this fallback behavior in cases where `typing_extensions` is not installed.", align 1
