@anon.e792752b4454889dead1a66caae2c60f.1082 = private unnamed_addr constant [571 x i8] c"Exempt classes and functions decorated with any of the enumerated\0Adecorators from being moved into type-checking blocks.\0A\0ACommon examples include Pydantic's `@pydantic.validate_call` decorator\0A(for functions) and attrs' `@attrs.define` decorator (for classes).\0A\0AThis also supports framework decorators like FastAPI's `fastapi.FastAPI.get`\0Awhich will work across assignments in the same module.\0A\0AFor example:\0A```python\0Aimport fastapi\0A\0Aapp = FastAPI(\22app\22)\0A\0A@app.get(\22/home\22)\0Adef home() -> str: ...\0A```\0A\0AHere `app.get` will correctly be identified as `fastapi.FastAPI.get`.", align 1
