@anon.e792752b4454889dead1a66caae2c60f.1547 = private unnamed_addr constant [518 x i8] c"The character Ruff uses at the end of a line.\0A\0A* `auto`: The newline style is detected automatically on a file per file basis. Files with mixed line endings will be converted to the first detected line ending. Defaults to `\\n` for files that contain no line endings.\0A* `lf`: Line endings will be converted to `\\n`. The default line ending on Unix.\0A* `cr-lf`: Line endings will be converted to `\\r\\n`. The default line ending on Windows.\0A* `native`: Line endings will be converted to `\\n` on Unix and `\\r\\n` on Windows.", align 1
